id: pm-starter-snapshot-sdk
title: Snapshot linked-test extension installation can replace the source SDK with a self-symlink
description: "Running the linked recipes test with no PM context and snapshot workspace exposes shared node_modules through a symlink. The packaged extension-install fixture then replaces the source SDK dependency with a self-referential link. Subsequent source typecheck cannot resolve the SDK. Reproduce through pm test on the recipes fixture; npm ci restores the dependency tree. This affects linked-test snapshot isolation, not package runtime behavior. Evidence is recorded on pm-starter-7tp5."
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 2
